{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261102/photo/bkn-20261102010637154-1102_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261102022150\"/><p>阿曼蘇丹海賽姆開始訪華。</p><p>阿曼蘇丹海賽姆周日（1日）抵達北京，開始對中國進行為期兩天的國事訪問。</p><p>此次訪問是海賽姆蘇丹繼任以來首次訪華，也是中國阿曼兩國建交48年來阿曼國家元首首次訪華。中國外交部發言人日前表示，中方願同阿方一道以此訪為契機，推動兩國戰略夥伴關係取得更大進展。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T00:47:44.397616+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":146,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-01T17:06:37+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-02T04:19:16.221154+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T00:41:48.823787+00:00","content_hash":"e9cd05d3a54a98502e92ea4ab1023658f80831c7ad334a7162bc0d4d41167ba6","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}